From: u5b0c9158bfa781ba at groups.google.com (Saptarshi Guha)
Date: Mon, 20 Dec 2010 17:07:34 +0000
Subject: Re: [rhipe] GREP application on Hadoop using RHIPE
Message-ID: <UHZJFUFH188.Lx3PrDd7FuMJ@rhipe.groups.google.com>
